{"id":"7c23bc3f0257a54f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure6 Finite Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure — ZFC Measure6 Finite Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure — ZFC Measure6 Finite Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure — ZFC Measure6 Finite Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure-space candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finiteness is a property of a typed measure space, not of an arbitrary function merely evaluated at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S$ (measure-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{FiniteMeasure}(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":906,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2619","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure6-finite-measure]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}